.124" end="00:41.766">hatred,</span> <span begin="00:41.766" end="00:42.529">sorrow,</span> <span begin="00:42.529" end="00:43.039">des</span><span begin="00:43.039" end="00:43.480">per</span><span begin="00:43.480" end="00:44.262">ation</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恐惧 仇恨 悲伤 绝望</span></p><p begin="00:44.292" end="00:47.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:44.292" end="00:45.068">Even</span> <span begin="00:45.068" end="00:45.495">you</span> <span begin="00:45.495" end="00:45.929">look</span> <span begin="00:45.929" end="00:47.212">miserable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连你也看起来很痛苦</span></p><p begin="00:47.222" end="00:49.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:47.222" end="00:47.755">Look</span> <span begin="00:47.804" end="00:48.189">down</span> <span begin="00:48.189" end="00:48.503">from</span> <span begin="00:48.503" end="00:49.111">above</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">俯瞰眼前的一切</span></p><p begin="00:49.121" end="00:50.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:49.121" end="00:49.711">I</span> <span begin="00:49.711" end="00:50.130">feel</span> <span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.735">awful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉很难受</span></p><p begin="00:50.945" end="00:52.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:50.945" end="00:51.141">The</span> <span begin="00:51.141" end="00:51.566">time</span> <span begin="00:51.566" end="00:51.840">has</span> <span begin="00:51.840" end="00:52.026">come</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时机已到</span></p><p begin="00:52.026" end="00:53.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:52.026" end="00:52.476">Let's</span> <span begin="00:52.476" end="00:52.922">all</span> <span begin="00:52.922" end="00:53.349">go</span> <span begin="00:53.349" end="00:53.818">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都回家吧</span></p><p begin="00:53.818" end="00:57.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:53.818" end="00:54.444">Si</span><span begin="00:54.444" end="00:55.131">nister</span> <span begin="00:55.131" end="00:55.943">faces,</span> <span begin="00:55.943" end="00:56.769">growing</span> <span begin="00:56.769" end="00:57.668">curses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">邪恶的面孔 无尽的诅咒</span></p><p begin="00:57.698" end="00:59.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:57.698" end="00:58.069">This</span> <span begin="00:58.069" end="00:58.232">is</span> <span begin="00:58.232" end="00:58.435">my</span> <span begin="00:58.435" end="00:58.697">last</span> <span begin="00:58.697" end="00:59.769">war</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我最后的战争</span></p><p begin="01:01.509" end="01:07.792" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:01.509" end="01:01.991">An</span><span begin="01:02.263" end="01:02.791">gels</span> <span begin="01:03.098" end="01:03.891">playing</span> <span begin="01:03.891" end="01:04.595">disguised</span> <span begin="01:04.829" end="01:05.467">with</span> <span begin="01:05.583" end="01:06.071">de</span><span begin="01:06.071" end="01:06.748">vil's</span> <span begin="01:07.009" end="01:07.357">fa</span><span begin="01:07.357" end="01:07.792">ces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天使伪装在魔鬼的面孔下</span></p><p begin="01:08.113" end="01:14.707" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:08.113" end="01:08.697">Chil</span><span begin="01:09.062" end="01:09.564">dren</span> <span begin="01:09.814" end="01:10.313">cling</span> <span begin="01:10.313" end="01:10.571">to</span> <span begin="01:10.571" end="01:10.947">their</span> <span begin="01:10.947" end="01:11.219">coins</span> <span begin="01:11.457" end="01:12.758">squeezing</span> <span begin="01:13.148" end="01:13.532">out</span> <span begin="01:13.532" end="01:14.001">their</span> <span begin="01:14.001" end="01:14.707">wisdom</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孩子们怀着美好期待 倾尽所有的智慧</span></p><p begin="01:14.817" end="01:21.307" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:14.817" end="01:15.399">An</span><span begin="01:15.657" end="01:16.287">gels</span> <span begin="01:16.507" end="01:17.434">planning</span> <span begin="01:17.434" end="01:17.903">disguised</span> <span begin="01:18.225" end="01:18.719">with</span> <span begin="01:19.030" end="01:19.478">de</span><span begin="01:19.478" end="01:20.375">vil's</span> <span begin="01:20.375" end="01:20.649">fa</span><span begin="01:20.649" end="01:21.307">ces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天使伪装在魔鬼的面孔下</span></p><p begin="01:21.327" end="01:27.928" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:21.327" end="01:21.988">Chil</span><span begin="01:22.227" end="01:22.823">dren</span> <span begin="01:23.126" end="01:23.622">cling</span> <span begin="01:23.622" end="01:23.957">on</span> <span begin="01:23.957" end="01:24.299">to</span> <span begin="01:24.299" end="01:24.632">their</span> <span begin="01:24.839" end="01:25.281">ve</span><span begin="01:25.670" end="01:26.148">ry</span> <span begin="01:26.432" end="01:26.842">last</span> <span begin="01:26.842" end="01:27.928">coins</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孩子们紧握最后的希望</span></p><p begin="01:28.040" end="01:30.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:28.040" end="01:29.071">Destruction</span> <span begin="01:29.606" end="01:29.737">and</span> <span begin="01:29.737" end="01:30.998">regeneration</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毁灭 重生</span></p><p begin="01:31.008" end="01:34.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:31.008" end="01:31.636">You</span> <span begin="01:31.783" end="01:32.382">are</span> <span begin="01:32.382" end="01:32.482">the</span> <span begin="01:32.482" end="01:33.143">real</span> <span begin="01:33.623" end="01:34.592">enemy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是真正的敌人<