.564" end="03:27.675">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在放学时间 伴随那响起的铃声</span></p><p begin="03:27.685" end="03:30.998" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:27.685" end="03:28.250">だん</span><span begin="03:28.413" end="03:28.890">だん</span><span begin="03:28.890" end="03:29.342">と落っ</span><span begin="03:29.342" end="03:30.106">こちて</span><span begin="03:30.106" end="03:30.468">ゆ</span><span begin="03:30.468" end="03:30.998">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐从天穹坠落</span></p><p begin="03:31.008" end="03:34.310" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:31.008" end="03:31.543">帰</span><span begin="03:31.543" end="03:31.903">り</span><span begin="03:31.903" end="03:32.285">道</span><span begin="03:32.285" end="03:32.826">を</span><span begin="03:32.826" end="03:33.548">終わらせ</span><span begin="03:33.548" end="03:33.920">ない</span><span begin="03:33.920" end="03:34.310">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不会让归途就这样终结</span></p><p begin="03:34.320" end="03:37.599" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:34.320" end="03:34.962">泣いて</span><span begin="03:35.257" end="03:35.680">いい</span><span begin="03:35.680" end="03:35.818">よ</span><span begin="03:35.982" end="03:36.530">今</span><span begin="03:36.530" end="03:37.005">だけ</span><span begin="03:37.005" end="03:37.599">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少此刻 不必再强忍泪水</span></p><p begin="03:37.709" end="03:41.212" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:37.709" end="03:38.316">線</span><span begin="03:38.316" end="03:38.585">路</span><span begin="03:38.585" end="03:39.218">沿い</span><span begin="03:39.218" end="03:39.480">に</span><span begin="03:39.480" end="03:39.801">消え</span><span begin="03:39.801" end="03:40.259">ちゃっ</span><span begin="03:40.259" end="03:40.531">た</span><span begin="03:40.531" end="03:40.704">菜</span><span begin="03:40.704" end="03:40.901">の</span><span begin="03:40.901" end="03:41.212">花</